# .dockerignore

# Thư mục build
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# IDE
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Docker
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*

# Temp files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.cache
**/temp/
**/logs/

# NuGet packages
**/packages/
**/*.nupkg

# OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db